        <table:table-column table:style-name="C6"/>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="6"><text:p>為了確認安否而公開信息（請選「希望」「不希望」的任意壹個，並打○。）</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="5"><text:p>您同意通過網頁或報道機構等公開避難者（您的）信息嗎？</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="CenterCell"><text:p>希望・不希望</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="5"><text:p>當親戚、同個住所的人、朋友問及您的安否時，您同意提供避難者（您的）信息嗎？</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="CenterCell"><text:p>希望・不希望</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="HeaderCell" table:number-rows-spanned="3"><text:p>房屋受災狀況</text:p><text:p>※請在該當的選項上畫圈。</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="5"><text:p>有　・　無　※選“有”後，請詳細填寫住房受害狀況。</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:covered-table-cell/>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="5"><text:p>※填寫例</text:p><text:p>・房子倒塌，近期內無法居住。</text:p><text:p>・室內收拾好後，可以回去居住。</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
